        "heading_e9Mfin": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Thoughtfully made. Effortlessly worn.",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "heading_class": "h2",
            "uppercase": true
          }
        },
        "text_G96ND8": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Vera Studio was born from a love for thoughtful design, timeless silhouettes, and the little details that make everyday dressing feel special. We believe a wardrobe should feel personal, effortless, and entirely your own. Our approach to fashion is rooted in simplicity. We bring together considered fabrics, refined shapes, and versatile essentials that move naturally with you. Each piece is designed to feel comfortable, look beautiful, and find its place in your everyday life.</p><p><em><strong>“Less, but considered. Simple, but never ordinary. Made for the moments that make up a life.”</strong></em></p><p>We believe the most meaningful wardrobes aren't built overnight. They're collected over time, shaped by personal style, familiar favourites, and pieces that feel just as relevant season after season. For us, getting dressed is about choosing well, wearing often, and finding confidence in the understated.&nbsp;</p><p>At Vera Studio, we celebrate quality over quantity, intention over impulse, and timeless design over passing trends. Because the pieces we return to most often are usually the ones that feel the most like us.</p>",
            "size": "medium"
          }
        }
