        "text_47kki8": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><em><strong>“Creating a wardrobe that feels timeless, personal, and effortlessly yours.”</strong></em></p><p>Vera Studio began with a simple belief: what we wear should feel as good as it looks. Inspired by understated elegance and the beauty of everyday essentials, our vision is to bring together thoughtful design, considered details, and pieces you'll reach for season after season.<br/><br/>For us, style isn't about following every trend. It's about discovering what feels right, choosing with intention, and finding confidence in the simplicity of less.</p>",
